          "text": "XIC,%I0.0 XIO,Timers[1].DN TON,Timers[0],3000",
          "comment": "Blinker: with %I0.0 closed, Timers[0] times 3 s and Timers[1] another 2 s; Timers[1].DN restarts the cycle."
